330
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,560
Dive in!

331
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:45,960
Go, go.

332
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,320
Let's go, guys.

333
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:50,360
- Nice!
- Push, push.

334
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:51,097
We got this.

335
00:21:51,121 --> 00:21:53,480
We got this. Yes!

336
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:04,680
Three wins!

337
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:06,400
Take that, Blue Viper!

338
00:22:17,680 --> 00:22:18,880
