339
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:21,360
- Take it. Here you go.
- Here I come!

340
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:24,920
Go, go!

341
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,976
Kill them all.

342
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,040
Guys, dive it.

343
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,240
This is our chance.

344
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,040
Come on.

345
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:35,840
- Come on, this is it.
- Let's go!

346
00:22:39,520 --> 00:22:40,520
I can get more kills.

347
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,200
That's how it's done!

348
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:02,240
